A||||12||Rodney||Free front gas hood strut kit for R&D||||1||
Z||000000||Rodney||07-31-2001||08:54 AM||||I have a free front hood gas strut kit to give away to someone who is willing to try it. There are 2 requirements. One is you have a digital camera and can post pictures of it on the Forum and the other is that your front compartment is nice and neat and clean. Any takers? This strut kit replaces the front mechanical assembly that holds the front hood open. With this strut kit you never have to push a lever to get the hood to close. Just push it down. To open the front hood just lift the hood open and it easily stays up. This kit raises the hood to the same height as the upper setting of the OEM support. ||||reg||1
